

6 tbl     - olive oil
2/3 cup   - sugar.
1         - egg.
4 tsp     - vanilla.
1 1.2 cup - flour.
3/4 tsp   - baking powder.
1/2 tsp   - salt.
1 tbl     - milk.

Preheat oven to 350.

Bowl #1 - Wet (Bigger bowl)
Mix oil & sugar.

Add egg & vanilla.

Bowl #2 - Dry
Mix flour, baking powder and salt.

Add 1/2 Dry into Wet bowl. Mix slowly.

Add the milk into bowl #1. Mix slowly.

Add the rest of the dry into the wet #1. Mix slowly.

Place on cookie sheet in little dough balls. Flatten a bit.

Bake 12-14 min.

Cool 5-10 min on cookie sheet.
